<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SIGMA SKIBIDI</title>

<style>
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 20px;
  background: #ffe4ee;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  color: #654552;
}

.card {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 360px;
  padding: 32px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  background: #fffafd;
  border: 1px solid #f6c8d8;
  border-radius: 20px;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 25px #e8a9bf33;
}

.heart {
  font-size: 28px;
  color: #e88eae;
}

h2 {
  font-weight: 500;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

p {
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: #927481;
}

button {
  margin-top: 12px;
  padding: 13px 22px;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 30px;
  background: #e88eae;
  color: white;
  font-size: 14px;
  cursor: pointer;
}

button:hover {
  background: #dc789d;
}

#confession {
  display: none;
  margin-top: 24px;
  padding-top: 20px;
  border-top: 1px solid #f5d8e3;
  text-align: left;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.9;
  white-space: pre-line;
}

.signature {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 16px;
  text-align: right;
  color: #c66f91;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="card">
  <div class="heart">♡</div>

  <h2>hey, you.</h2>

  <p>
    may sasabihin lang ako...<br>
    :0 papahelp lanf sana ako
  </p>

  <button onclick="openConfession()" id="openBtn">
    click this to open ♡
  </button>

  <div id="confession">
HAIII HAILEY,
I'M STARTING TO HAVE A CONFIDENCE TO SAY THIS I'M SERIOUS. 

I like TALKING TO YOU, I LOVE OUR MOMENTS,
I LOVE YOUR HUMOUR WE R SAME SIGMAAA🙏🏻🙏🏻

Haileyyy, I will not think twice na there's no PERFECT TIME, rayt time lang mero’n AND TUNG RAYT TIME NAYON IS THIS. 

First thing first, I'd feel HAPPY VERY HAPPY when I’m with you — everything is calm layk🥺🥺 mararamdaman ko ngiti ko OKAYIE ABOT LANGIT? SINO ANG MAY SALARIN? Hindi na me mag papa tumpik pa I WANT TO SAY MY FEELINGS NA. HAILEYY YOU GOT MY HEART HUHU🪷🎀🎀 YES I HAVE A CRUSH ON YOU ’DIKO INEXPECT TO EEYUC AKOUEE, TIME IS TICKING. Hailey, IHAVEACRUSH ONYOU DONT BASH ME PLEASE BE SIGMA TO MEE



